Package: brotypist
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: BroTypist contributors <noreply@localhost>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: @DEPENDS@
Conflicts: inklow
Replaces: inklow
Description: Local-first predictive typing for supported desktop text inputs
 Private writing assistance with frozen Python, Qt and AT-SPI bindings.
 Supports Ubuntu 24.04+ and Debian 13+ amd64 with X11, and compatible KDE
 Wayland text inputs after explicit input-method selection. Other Wayland
 compositors are unsupported. Requires AVX2, FMA and F16C. Models download
 only on request and are not included.
 User settings, model caches and writing history are never package-owned.
